  "body": "This is the synapse side of https://github.com/vector-im/riot-web/issues/7335.\r\n\r\nLooks like there may be some bug where your /sync on joining a remote room does not contain a pagination token, so you can't paginate backwards.  If you later re-/sync you get a valid pagination token.  It feels like there's a `if len(local dag) == 0: pagination_token = None` somewhere in synapse.",
